cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bexhoma, please cite the software version you used and the article below."
type: software
title: "Bexhoma: Benchmark Experiment Host Manager"
abstract: >-
  Bexhoma (Benchmark Experiment Host Manager) is a Python tool that manages
  benchmark experiments of Database Management Systems (DBMS) in Kubernetes
  clusters. It deploys the systems under test, runs data generators, loaders
  and benchmark drivers (DBMS-Benchmarker, HammerDB, Benchbase, YCSB) as
  containers, collects hardware metrics, and evaluates and reports the results,
  so that experiments can be repeated over varying configurations.
